    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds pretty intense. so these \"foam cells\" and the plaque are basically just clogging the pipes and making everything harder for the blood to move through. is there any way to actually stop that buildup from happening once it starts, or is it more about just managing how fast it gets worse?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
